        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7417, Ornate Solid Brass Crest Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFit for royalty, this ornate cabinet knob features luxurious embellishments on the handle. This knob is not for people who want to make a simple statement—it exudes richness that will lend its ornate styling well to fancier home décors. The Ornate Crest Cabinet Knob is available in 3 diameters and 3 finishes. Choose from polished brass, antique nickel, or shaded bronze. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Ornate Crest Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>7417/28:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>7417/35:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>7417/42:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
